{
  "key": 17459,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "FightAreaMiddleHouse_Text_SeePeakMtCoronet",
      "en_US": [
        "Even from here, we could see the\n",
        "peak of Mt. Coronet.\r",
        "Most people didn’t notice what\n",
        "happened up there, but I did.\r",
        "But I don’t know what took place\n",
        "exactly, or anything like that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaMiddleHouse_Text_FanaticalAboutBattling",
      "en_US": [
        "Everyone’s fanatical about battling\n",
        "here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FightAreaMiddleHouse_Text_CheckOutGlobalTerminal",
      "en_US": [
        "People are people, and I’m me.\n",
        "I don’t like to be compared.\r",
        "But comparing with other people reveals\n",
        "things about yourself sometimes, too.\r",
        "That’s why you should check out the\n",
        "Global Terminal in Jubilife City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Hello! I’m the eccentric\n",
        "Bottle Cap fanatic!\r",
        "I can’t get enough Bottle Caps!\n",
        "Will you share some with me?\f",
        "I will help your Pokémon if you do!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Awh... I thought maybe I had\n",
        "found a fellow fanatic!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "But... you don’t even have\n",
        "any of those bottle caps!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Yippee! Which one will you give me?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "BOTTLE CAP"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "GOLD BOTTLE CAP"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "CANCEL"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Marvelous! I will help increase\n",
        "this Pokémon’s stats!\r",
        "Which stat should I work with?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "HP"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "ATTACK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "DEFENSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "SP. ATTACK"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "SP. DEFENSE"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "SPEED"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Hehehe, I will bring out the\n",
        "maximum potential of your Pokémon!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "...There we go! Your Pokémon\n",
        "is looking incredible!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Great choice! Let me work on that\n",
        "stat now...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "I appreciate wanting to give me a\n",
        "bottle cap, but your Pokémon doesn’t\f",
        "need my help!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_00021",
      "en_US": [
        "Ahh, wonderful! Which Pokémon shall\n",
        "I help now?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_Intro",
      "en_US": [
        "Wahaha, I’m a base points fanatic!\n",
        "Have you brought me a Pokémon that\f",
        "I may steal -- I mean, borrow --\f",
        "base points from?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_Declined",
      "en_US": [
        "But... Wow...\n",
        "I thought you would let me, ugh."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_AskSelectPokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "Wahaha, excellent! Whom shall I\n",
        "borrow from?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_Confirm",
      "en_US": [
        "Are you sure you want me to\n",
        "take {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s base points?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_Finished",
      "en_US": [
        "Bam! Your {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}’s base points\n",
        "are all mine! Thank you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000197_BasePointsFanatic_ZeroEvs",
      "en_US": [
        "What are you playing at?\n",
        "This Pokémon doesn’t even have\f",
        "any base points for me to take!"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
